  m_Name: tf_return
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LastWard.Runtime::LastWard.Puzzles.ClueDefinition
  clueId: tf_return
  displayTitle: Nailed Beside The Stairhead
  bodyText: The floor is not the same on the way out. I do not mean you forget it
    - I mean the doors are in different walls and the stair you came up is a cupboard
    now. There is no trick to it and there is nothing to work out. Walk. Keep walking.
    Do not stop in a room to get your bearings and DO NOT TURN ROUND to see how far
    you have come, because the corridor behind you is the part that is listening,
    and it comes when it is looked at. I have watched a man stand still for eleven
    seconds. Only the light came back.
  knowledgeValue: 12
